                                <div style="background: #eee; padding: 15px; text-align: center; margin: 10px 0;">
                                    <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px;">Vote for Your Favorite!</div>
                                    <button style="background: #007bff; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; margin: 5px;">
                                        🌟 Contestant 1
